# Everything listed here is generated and reproducible. Nothing is ignored by a
# blanket rule with tracked exceptions underneath it — that is how four vendored
# typefaces once ended up committed against the rules and the next two did not.

# Typefaces (`just setup`) and work imagery (`just build`).
assets/
# Content-addressed HTTP cache; makes harvests resumable.
cache/
# The 1.6M intermediate the build reads. The small files the page fetches at
# runtime — tour, galleries, floorplan — are committed, as is the curated prose.
data/catalogue.json
docs/reference
__pycache__/
